   [2m[39m [0m[38;2;255;255;255m  [2m[39m2.[0m tester writes a test that fails for the bug's own reason. It edits [38;2;177;185;249mtests/[39m only, and reports the failure.[38;2;255;255;255m
   [2m[39m [0m[38;2;255;255;255m  [2m[39m3.[0m coder fixes the code so that test passes. It edits only the files the lead named for it, and never [38;2;177;185;249mtests/[39m.[38;2;255;255;255m
